<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->[QuestInfo], hoping to ask your consent. Kiiros will not settle too close to [map_definite] to avoid causing any inconvenience to you.\n\nUpon obtaining your consent, kiiros will begin the process of constructing their own settlement, which will take some time.</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->A group of displaced kiiro wishes to establish a village near [map_definite] in order to settle down and end their wandering life</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->The kiiros wishes to establish a new village near [map_definite] for easier communication with you</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription->[QuestInfo]，希望能够征求你的同意。绮罗们不会在距离[map_definite]过近的地方定居以免给你带来任何不便。\n\n在求得你的同意后，绮罗们会开始着手建造自己的家园，这会花费一段时间。</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->一群流离失所的绮罗想要在[map_definite]附近建立一个村落，以便安顿下来，结束漂泊流浪的生活</li>
    <li>QuestInfo->绮罗族想要在[map_definite]附近建立一个新的村镇，以便和你进行更方便的联络</li>
  </Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questName->kiiro new settlement</li>
  -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName->绮罗新村镇</li>
  </Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: kiiro town constructing -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>村镇建造中</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro's village is progressing smoothly in its construction. Before long, a brand-new settlement belonging to the Kiiro will emerge near [map_definite]. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>绮罗的村落正在顺利建设中。过不了多久，一个属于绮罗的崭新定居点就会出现在[map_definite]附近了。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-0.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: kiiro town resource request -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>村镇资源请求</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro's town construction has encountered a shortage of building materials... They are requesting [requestedThingCount] x woodlogs from you to expedite the completion of the town. Without these materials, the construction progress will become extremely slow, requiring an additional [finishTimeTicks_duration] to finish. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>绮罗的村落建设遇到了缺少建材的麻烦……她们向你请求[requestedThingCount]x原木，以便尽快完成村落的建设。没有这些建材的话，建设的进度将变得极为缓慢，大概还需要额外的[finishTimeTicks_duration]才能完成。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: assistance appreciation -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>援助感谢</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The Kiiro have received the building materials for assistance! Thanks to your help, the Kiiro's town should be completed soon. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>绮罗们已经收到援助的建材！多亏了你的帮忙，绮罗的村落应该很快就能建成了。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.Delay.node.nodes.RandomNode.nodes.Sequence-1.nodes.Kiiro_NewSettlementUnderConstructionTradeRequestFulfilled.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Kiiro village construction completed -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>绮罗村镇建造完成</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: A new kiiro village has been constructed near [map_definite]. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>一处新的绮罗村镇在[map_definite]附近建成了。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.FinishConstruction.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [resolvedQuestName] failed -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>[resolvedQuestName]失效</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Due to the hostile relationship with the kiiros, [resolvedQuestName] cannot be completed further. -->
  <Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>由于与绮罗族处于敌对关系，[resolvedQuestName]无法继续完成。</Kiiro_NewSettlementEstablish.root.nodes.factionBecameHostileToPlayer.node.nodes.Letter.text.slateRef>
  
</LanguageData>